From 58ce831a0c4a218dab9ab4c65e0bf5319d7a768e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:15:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] SDF: bake a local distance atlas once at startup;
 instances only move their placement

Replaces the camera-snapped three-clipmap rebuild with DistanceAtlasSpace (one volume per
distinct mesh, baked once, trilinear local sampling through each instance's world-to-local
map). UploadScene keeps the atlas when the topology is unchanged; moved instances are masked
out of exact queries and only cast soft SDF shadows. DistanceFieldConstruct.slang removed.
Adds a CPU visual proof under VisualProof/DistanceAtlas.
